55,3,1,talk,Minato,,I like the Wetland Restoration. It seems to fit the water issues and avoids massive earth-moving.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,"The Market Plaza is the cheapest to maintain, but the Woodland Walk sounds too expensive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I prefer the Wetland Restoration. The previous basin worked well, and it's more natural.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Sports Terraces or Wetland Restoration. We have volunteers for both, which is essential.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Market Plaza blocks the tram path. Wetland Restoration solves the drainage and heat.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, would the Market Plaza be too hard to build if the ground is slippery?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"Maybe, but the upkeep is the real nightmare. However, @Shunichi is right about the tram.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, the volunteers for habitat would love the wetlands.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. The sports volunteers are great, but the habitat group is already active upriver.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,Wetland Restoration is the only one that addresses the drainage callouts I saw.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm voting for the wetlands.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,May,,"If the others are leaning that way, I'll consider it, provided the cost is managed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is the most sustainable choice for our community.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It aligns with our available volunteer support.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,It's the most rational choice for the land's behavior.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
